## Upstream lineage

Fluxora is an independent product. It is not an official release of, and does
not claim any affiliation with, any upstream project.

Fluxora's codebase is derived from **bettbox+**
(<https://github.com/Tiam9173/bettboxplus>, v1.19.2, commit `dcad2db`), which is
distributed under the GNU General Public License v3.0. bettbox+ is in turn a
rebuild of **Bettbox** (<https://github.com/appshubcc/Bettbox>).

Fluxora's independent product identity — branding, UI, design tokens, theming,
and the Windows loopback component — was developed on top of that base starting
2026-09-25 (commit `7d47c3f`).

