## Historical third-party binary (removed)

Earlier revisions of this repository included a third-party Windows loopback
exemption tool at `windows/WindowsLoopbackManager.exe`, obtained from
`appshubcc/Windows-Loopback-Manager` (author: `tiagonmas`).

The upstream project does not publish a licence for that binary, so its licence
status is unknown. It has therefore been removed from this repository and is no
longer distributed in any form.

Its function is now provided by Fluxora's own implementation,
`FluxoraLoopbackManager`, built from `windows/fluxora_loopback/`. That component
is an independent implementation and is the only loopback tool shipped.

For audit traceability, the removed file was:

    path   : windows/WindowsLoopbackManager.exe
    size   : 197120 bytes
    sha256 : d9b1bd0e9f05c8f046578c6f870b1c6822fbd660a01c55a4c838386432215263
